# Conformance probe pack for two overlapping lines on a fixed layout with no
# gates (ruling 5 of 0.5, ruling 7 of 0.17): an earlier line written from its
# `default` wins over a later line with a present key on the bits they share.
# Fixed `bits` layout, least significant bit first. Public. No kinds. One byte
# per word.
#
#   bits 0-7     x (default 15)
#   bits 4-11    y, sharing bits 4-7 with x
format     conformance-gates-default-overlap
version    0.17.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
field   probe.x   0:0:8    uint
default probe.x   15
field   probe.y   0:4:8    uint
